    <comment>Update to 3.3.0 — fix Factory FTBFS on Python 3.14 (botdel sr#1371864).

- Update to version 3.3.0:
  * Add support for Python 3.14 (fixes Factory FTBFS)
  * Drop EOL Python versions; require 3.10+
  * Convert dict features to Feature objects in
    FeatureCollection
  * Fix __all__ to be a sequence of strings
  * Remove simplejson
- Point URL at the jazzband/geojson repository</comment>
